      {
        "image": "images/woman-reading-letter.jpg",
        "alt": {
          "zh": "维米尔《读信的蓝衣女子》约1663，阿姆斯特丹荷兰国立博物馆",
          "en": "Johannes Vermeer, Woman Reading a Letter, c. 1663, Rijksmuseum, Amsterdam"
        },
        "caption": {
          "zh": "约1663年 · 阿姆斯特丹荷兰国立博物馆",
          "en": "c. 1663 · Rijksmuseum, Amsterdam"
        },
        "kicker": "ACT I",
        "title": {
          "zh": "第一幕 · 一封信",
          "en": "A letter"
        },
        "text": {
          "zh": "一个清晨，她还穿着睡衣外套，就站着读起了信。这封信大概来得很突然。只有她和写信的人，知道里面写了什么。",
          "en": "Early one morning, still in her night jacket, she stands reading a letter. It seems to have arrived unexpectedly. Only she and the writer know what it says."
        }
      },
      {
        "image": "images/woman-reading-letter.jpg",
        "alt": {
          "zh": "维米尔《读信的蓝衣女子》约1663，阿姆斯特丹荷兰国立博物馆",
          "en": "Johannes Vermeer, Woman Reading a Letter, c. 1663, Rijksmuseum, Amsterdam"
        },
        "caption": {
          "zh": "约1663年 · 阿姆斯特丹荷兰国立博物馆",
          "en": "c. 1663 · Rijksmuseum, Amsterdam"
        },
        "kicker": "ACT II",
        "title": {
          "zh": "第二幕 · 改了又改",
          "en": "Changed and changed again"
        },
        "text": {
          "zh": "2010至2011年，荷兰国立博物馆修复了这幅画，发现她的外套原本画得更宽，下面可能还有一圈毛领。维米尔后来把它改得更简洁了。",
          "en": "In 2010–11, the Rijksmuseum restored the painting and found that her jacket was originally wider, perhaps with a fur collar. Vermeer later made it simpler."
        }
      },
      {
        "image": "images/woman-reading-letter.jpg",
        "alt": {
          "zh": "维米尔《读信的蓝衣女子》约1663，阿姆斯特丹荷兰国立博物馆",
          "en": "Johannes Vermeer, Woman Reading a Letter, c. 1663, Rijksmuseum, Amsterdam"
        },
        "caption": {
          "zh": "约1663年 · 阿姆斯特丹荷兰国立博物馆",
          "en": "c. 1663 · Rijksmuseum, Amsterdam"
        },
        "kicker": "ACT III",
        "title": {
          "zh": "第三幕 · 第一幅",
          "en": "The first"
        },
        "text": {
          "zh": "这是荷兰国立博物馆收藏的第一幅维米尔，从1885年起就在这里展出。画上没有签名。",
          "en": "This was the first Vermeer in the Rijksmuseum, on display there since 1885. It bears no signature."
        }
      }
    ],
